  "sourceReview": "Reviewed new minimal HTTP API and immutable in-memory store. Title validation precedes writes; lock covers lookup, version comparison and mutation; read/list return immutable snapshots. PUT/DELETE require supported version tags. Original exercise modules remain intact; README link snapshot verified.",
